# DsCable docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsCable
  aria-label="Cable, Haifa North to Haifa South"
  from={{
    x: 40,
    y: 60
  }}
  to={{
    x: 320,
    y: 60
  }}
/>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsCable
    from={{ x: 40, y: 60 }}
    to={{ x: 320, y: 60 }}
    aria-label="Cable, Haifa North to Haifa South" />;

